From 2a80b10fec200f7f3fb9200ecab2912e3124ba34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:31:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Raise Purchase/Contractor Navigator function timeouts to 300s
 now on Vercel Pro
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Team streamnavigator upgraded from Hobby to Pro (2026-08-31). Live
verification of the previous stuck-processing fix showed that even a single
generation attempt for a Purchase Navigator report was routinely exceeding
the Hobby plan's 60s hard cap (confirmed on two separate real runs,
including the customer's own real paid Highlander submission), so reports
were reliably hitting the graceful-failure path instead of ever completing.

- vercel.json: maxDuration 60 -> 300 for api/get-navigator-submission.js and
  api/generate-contractor-report.js (300s is the ceiling Vercel Pro allows
  for Node.js serverless functions; Hobby was capped at 60s).
- purchase-engine.js: WEB_SEARCH_TOOL max_uses restored from 3 back to 5 —
  the earlier trim was a stopgap to fit inside 60s and is no longer needed,
  and more search rounds means fresher pricing data for the
  alternative-comparison and depreciation/resale sections.
- purchase-engine.js, get-navigator-submission.js: updated comments that
  referenced the old 60s/70s figures to reflect the new 300s ceiling and
  ~320s stuck-processing detection window. The single-attempt-per-invocation
  architecture and stuck-processing self-heal are kept as a safety net even
  though a single attempt should now have ample room — they cost nothing
  when generation succeeds and still protect against a genuinely hung
  attempt regardless of plan.
- tests/get-navigator-submission-stuck.test.js: updated fixture timestamps
  to sit on the correct side of the new ~320s stuck threshold (was tuned to
  the old ~70s one); all 31 tests still pass.
---
 api/_lib/purchase-engine.js                  | 53 +++++++++++---------
 api/get-navigator-submission.js              | 15 +++---
 tests/get-navigator-submission-stuck.test.js | 12 ++---
 vercel.json                                  |  4 +-
 4 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

